      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pine_Hill%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2021, the borough of Pine Valley agreed to merge with Pine Hill, adding significant taxable property and a golf course.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pine_Hill%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The merger of Pine Valley into Pine Hill was the first in New Jersey since the formation of Princeton in 2011.",
